From 47cfd082f651bbef2ba2007b45e14926ab8a9dab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:36:39 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(tools): convert STEP bodies to DXF half-profiles and
 import/export DXF

Add a clean-room ASCII DXF writer, conservative band reduction for
SpunProfile, ISO 13399 STEP-to-DXF and DXF half-profile conversion with
an explicit CENTRELINE layer, SetToolBody constructors, MCP tools, and
Profile/Body editor UI workflows.

Fixes #743
